review_sentences.text:
---------------------------------

After reading the responses from authors, I have clearer noticed some important contributions in the proposed methods:

1) A novel regularization function with a scaling factor was introduced for improving the capability of binary neural networks; 
2) The proposed activation function can enhance the training procedure of BNNs effectively;
3) Binary networks trained using the proposed method achieved the highest performance over the state-of-the-art methods.
